{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Let's evaluate the two sigma expressions and see which of them results in $4 + 25 + 64 + 121$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sum_{i=0}^3\\left(i^2+2i+4\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left[(0)^2 \\!+\\! 2(0) \\!+\\! 4\\right] \\!+\\! \\left[(1)^2 \\!+\\! 2(1) \\!+\\! 4\\right] \\!+\\! \\left[(2)^2 \\!+\\! 2(2) \\!+\\! 4\\right] \\!+\\! \\left[(3)^2 \\!+\\! 2(3) \\!+\\! 4\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4 + 7 + 12 + 19\n\\end{align}$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sum_{i=0}^3(3i+2)^2\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left[(3(0)+2)^2\\right]+\\left[(3(1)+2)^2\\right]+\\left[(3(2)+2)^2\\right]+\\left[(3(3)+2)^2\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4 + 25 + 64 + 121\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, only $\\displaystyle\\sum_{i=0}^3(3i+2)^2$ is equal to $4 + 25 + 64 + 121$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Consider the sum $4 + 25 + 64 + 121$.\n\n**Which expression is equal to the above sum?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\displaystyle\\sum_{i=0}^3\\left(i^2+2i+4\\right)$","correct":false},{"content":"$\\displaystyle\\sum_{i=0}^3(3i+2)^2$","correct":true},{"content":"","isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
